<title>USA: Universal Self Care Inc posts Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Universal Self Care Inc posts Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>LIVONIA, Mich. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Self Care Inc said Monday it had a September 30 first quarter loss of $164,423 or $0.02 per share on 7,888,006 average shares outstanding. Revenues were $9.2 million.</p>
<p>It said the loss is primarily due to the increase in general and administrative expenses from the final consolidation of Patient Care Services, financing fees and interest expense.</p>
<p>The company did not provide year-ago comparative numbers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
